  "$id": "https://github.com/g-udi/design-system/themes/theme.schema.json",
  "title": "Gaudi theme",
  "description": "A Gaudi design-system theme: the themeable --ds-* contract for light and dark (src/tokens/THEMING.md). Colour groups: Surfaces, Text, Borders, Accent (primary), Focus, Success, Warning, Danger, Discovery, Info, Attention, Charts, Sidebar.",
